---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: locations
  size: 1
  alias: loc
permalink: "{{ loc.page }}"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ 'Korean BBQ in West Seattle, Alki Beach' if loc.key == 'alki' else 'Korean BBQ in Kent, WA: Menu and Hours' }}"
  description: "{{ 'All-you-can-eat Korean BBQ steps from the Alki Beach waterfront in West Seattle. ' if loc.key == 'alki' else 'The first Korean BBQ in Kent, WA, serving Kent, Renton, Auburn and South King County. ' }}Hours, menu, directions and reservations for Do Si Korean BBQ {{ loc.name }}."
  schemaRestaurants: "{{ loc.key }}"
---
{%- set l = loc | withPortal(apnosh) -%}
{%- set A = menus.ayce[loc.key] -%}
{%- set special = l.specialHours | upcomingSpecial if l.specialHours else [] -%}
<section class="hero hero--page">
  <div class="hero__media" aria-hidden="true">
    {% if loc.key == 'alki' %}{% img "alki-storefront", "", { sizes: "100vw", eager: true } %}{% else %}{% img "kent-storefront", "", { sizes: "100vw", eager: true, h: 1200 } %}{% endif %}
  </div>
  <div class="wrap hero__inner">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/locations/">Locations</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>{{ loc.name }}</span></nav>
    <p class="eyebrow">{{ loc.neighborhood }}</p>
    <h1 class="display h1">{{ loc.headline }}</h1>
    <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:28px">
      <a class="btn btn--red" href="{{ loc.reserveUrl }}" data-apnosh="book" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Reserve a table</a>
      {% if loc.orderUrl %}<a class="btn btn--light" href="{{ loc.orderUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Order pickup</a>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <p class="loc__links loc__links--hero"><a href="{{ loc.menuPage }}">See the {{ loc.name }} menu</a><a href="{{ l.phone | telHref }}">Call {{ l.phone }}</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="wrap loc-page">
    <div>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:28px">{{ loc.blurb }}</p>
      <div class="price-tiles">
        <a href="{{ loc.menuPage }}#ayce"><small>Signature</small><b>{{ A.signature }}</b><span>20 meats</span></a>
        <a href="{{ loc.menuPage }}#ayce"><small>Premium</small><b>{{ A.premium }}</b><span>28 meats</span></a>
        <a href="{{ loc.menuPage }}#ayce" class="is-hot"><small>Supreme</small><b>{{ A.supreme }}</b><span>32 meats + 7 apps</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="photo-strip">
        {% if loc.key == 'alki' %}
        <div>{% img "dining-room", "The dining room at Do Si Korean BBQ Alki Beach", { sizes: "33vw" } %}</div>
        <div>{% img "alki-deck-wide", "The rooftop deck at Alki Beach, with umbrellas over the water", { sizes: "33vw" } %}</div>
        <div>{% img "dining-windows", "Upstairs at Alki, with windows onto the beach", { sizes: "33vw" } %}</div>
        {% else %}
        <div>{% img "kent-storefront", "Do Si Korean BBQ on Kent-Kangley Road", { sizes: "33vw", h: 1200 } %}</div>
        <div>{% img "grill-spread", "Meats on the tabletop grill at Do Si Korean BBQ Kent", { sizes: "33vw" } %}</div>
        <div>{% img "kbbq-spread-2", "A full table of Korean BBQ, stews and sides", { sizes: "33vw" } %}</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="rules">
        {% for x in loc.extras %}<span>{{ x }}</span>{% endfor %}<span>90-minute AYCE</span><span>Kids 4–10 half price</span>
      </div>
      {% if loc.key == 'alki' %}
      <div class="quotes quotes--compact" style="margin-top:28px">
        {% for q in reviews.home | batch(3) | first %}<figure class="quote"><span class="stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</span><blockquote>“{{ q.quote }}”</blockquote><figcaption>{{ q.name }} · Google</figcaption></figure>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="fine"><span class="stars">★</span> {{ reviews.summary.rating }} average from {{ reviews.summary.count }} recent Google reviews</p>
      {% endif %}
      {% if loc.key == 'alki' %}<a class="callout" href="/private-events/"><span><b>Private events &amp; buyouts</b>Rent Do Si Alki for your group</span><span class="callout__go">Request a date →</span></a>{% endif %}
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:28px;font-size:.92rem">Serving {{ loc.areaServed | join(", ") }}.</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="info-card" aria-label="{{ loc.name }} details">
      <div>
        <h2>Address</h2>
        <a class="big" href="{{ l.address | mapsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ l.address.street }}<br>{{ l.address.city }}, {{ l.address.state }} {{ l.address.zip }}</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Phone</h2>
        <a class="big" href="{{ l.phone | telHref }}">{{ l.phone }}</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Hours</h2>
        <ul class="hours" data-hours='{{ l.hours | json }}'>{% for r in l.hours | hoursRows %}<li><span>{{ r.days }}</span><span>{{ r.time }}</span></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
        {% for s in special %}<p class="hours-special"><b>{{ s.date }}</b>: {{ s.time }}{% if s.reason %} · {{ s.reason }}{% endif %}</p>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--red" href="{{ loc.reserveUrl }}" data-apnosh="book" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Reserve</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ l.address | mapsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Directions</a>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
  {# ---- more about this restaurant: every fact here is on the menus or elsewhere on the site ---- #}
  <div class="wrap loc-more">
    {% if loc.key == 'alki' %}
    <p class="kr-label" lang="ko">알카이 비치</p>
    <h2 class="rule-head"><span class="accent">Korean BBQ</span> in West Seattle</h2>
    <div class="loc-more__grid">
      <article>
        <h3>All-you-can-eat on Alki Beach</h3>
        <p>Do Si Alki is an all-you-can-eat Korean BBQ restaurant on Alki Avenue, steps from the West Seattle waterfront. Every table has its own grill. Pick one of three tiers for the table: Signature at {{ A.signature }} with 20 meats, Premium at {{ A.premium }} with 28, or Supreme at {{ A.supreme }} with all 32, including USDA Choice Angus ribeye and boneless short rib.</p>
        <p>You order in rounds of up to 4 meats and 4 appetizers, with unlimited banchan, for 90 minutes. There is a 2-guest minimum, the whole table orders the same tier, and kids 4 to 10 are half price. <a href="{{ loc.menuPage }}#ayce">See the Alki Beach AYCE menu</a>.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Happy hour by the water</h3>
        <p>Happy hour is only at Alki Beach, from 2 to 5pm and again from 8pm to close. It comes with happy hour bites like corn cheese, wings and dumplings, house cocktails, $1 off beer and $2 off wine and liquor (excluding wells). <a href="{{ loc.menuPage }}#happy-hour">See the happy hour menu</a>.</p>
        <p>The full bar also pours soju and Do Si’s own cocktails. <a href="{{ loc.menuPage }}#drinks">See the drinks menu</a>.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>A rooftop deck and a private second floor</h3>
        <p>Upstairs, the dining room’s windows look onto the beach, and the rooftop deck looks out over the water. The second floor can be booked as a private space for up to 40 guests, any day of the week, for birthdays, company dinners, rehearsal dinners and holiday parties. Full restaurant buyouts are available too. <a href="/private-events/">Ask about a private event</a>.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Combos, classics and pickup</h3>
        <p>Not in the mood for all-you-can-eat? Order KBBQ combos for 2 or 4, à la carte meats for the grill, or Korean classics from the kitchen: fried chicken wings, seafood pancake, tokbokki, bibimbap, japchae, soft tofu stew and bento boxes. <a href="{{ loc.menuPage }}#combo-alacarte">See combos and à la carte</a>.</p>
        {% if loc.orderUrl %}<p>Eating at home or on the beach? <a href="{{ loc.orderUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Order pickup from Alki Beach</a>.</p>{% endif %}
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Finding us and booking</h3>
        <p>We are at {{ l.address.street }}, {{ l.address.city }}, {{ l.address.state }} {{ l.address.zip }}, a short trip from Admiral and the rest of West Seattle. Walk-ins are always welcome. For groups and weekend nights, we recommend <a href="{{ loc.reserveUrl }}" data-apnosh="book" target="_blank" rel="noopener">reserving a table online</a> or calling <a href="{{ l.phone | telHref }}">{{ l.phone }}</a>. An 18% gratuity is added for parties of 5 or more.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <p class="kr-label" lang="ko">켄트</p>
    <h2 class="rule-head"><span class="accent">Korean BBQ</span> in Kent, WA</h2>
    <div class="loc-more__grid">
      <article>
        <h3>All-you-can-eat in Kent</h3>
        <p>Do Si Kent is the first Korean BBQ restaurant in Kent, on Kent-Kangley Road. Every table has its own grill. Pick one of three tiers for the table: Signature at {{ A.signature }} with 20 meats, Premium at {{ A.premium }} with 28, or Supreme at {{ A.supreme }} with all 32, including USDA Choice Angus ribeye and boneless short rib.</p>
        <p>You order in rounds of up to 4 meats and 2 appetizers, with unlimited banchan, for 90 minutes. There is a 2-guest minimum, the whole table orders the same tier, and kids 4 to 10 are half price. <a href="{{ loc.menuPage }}#ayce">See the Kent AYCE menu</a>.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Lunch specials and bento boxes</h3>
        <p>Lunch specials run Monday to Friday, 11am to 4pm, and come with rice and banchan: beef, chicken or pork bulgogi, LA galbi, stir-fried squid, bibimbap, kimchi fried rice, japchae and three stews. Bento boxes add chicken wings and dumplings to your choice of LA galbi, bulgogi or stir-fried squid. <a href="{{ loc.menuPage }}#bento-lunch">See lunch and bento</a>.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Birthdays, teams and big tables</h3>
        <p>Kent is built for groups: birthdays, family dinners, coworkers and date nights, with plenty of parking outside. Book ahead for a large table, or <a href="/contact/#groups">tell us about your group</a> and we’ll help plan it. An 18% gratuity is added for parties of 5 or more.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Combos, classics and pickup</h3>
        <p>Not in the mood for all-you-can-eat? Order KBBQ combos for 2 or 4, à la carte meats for the grill, or Korean classics from the kitchen: fried chicken wings, seafood pancake, tokbokki, bibimbap, japchae and soft tofu stew, with soju and beer towers to share. <a href="{{ loc.menuPage }}#combo-alacarte">See combos and à la carte</a>.</p>
        {% if loc.orderUrl %}<p>Eating at home? <a href="{{ loc.orderUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Order pickup from Kent</a>.</p>{% endif %}
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Finding us and booking</h3>
        <p>We are at {{ l.address.street }}, {{ l.address.city }}, {{ l.address.state }} {{ l.address.zip }}, serving Kent, Renton, Auburn, Covington and the rest of South King County. Walk-ins are always welcome. For groups and weekend nights, we recommend <a href="{{ loc.reserveUrl }}" data-apnosh="book" target="_blank" rel="noopener">reserving a table online</a> or calling <a href="{{ l.phone | telHref }}">{{ l.phone }}</a>.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <h2 class="rule-head loc-more__faqhead"><span class="accent">Good</span> to know</h2>
    <div class="faq">
      {% set wanted = ["Do I need a reservation?", "How does all-you-can-eat work?", "Can I take leftovers home?", "Do you have vegetarian options?", "Can I order à la carte instead of AYCE?"] %}
      {% for f in faq %}{% if f.q in wanted or (loc.key == 'alki' and 'rent out' in f.q) or (loc.key == 'kent' and 'birthdays' in f.q) %}
      <details><summary>{{ f.q }}</summary><div class="answer"><p>{{ f.a | safe }}</p></div></details>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-top:20px"><a href="/faq/">All frequently asked questions</a></p>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap" style="margin-top:clamp(40px,6vw,72px)">
    <div class="map"><iframe title="Map to Do Si Korean BBQ {{ loc.name }}" src="{{ l.address | mapsEmbed }}" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe></div>
  </div>
</section>
